          "lang": "en",
          "outlet_id": "commondreams",
          "published_at": 1790612885,
          "summary": "President Trump’s Department of Transportation today finalized a rule gutting Corporate Average Fuel Economy, or CAFE, standards, which conserve billions of gallons of gas and save consumers billions at the pump. Trump’s action is illegal because the law requires that the fuel economy standards be set at the “maximum feasible” level. The final rule ignores the feasibility of clean technology and the millions of fuel-efficient cars already on the road. “Trump is tanking sensible mileage standards at the…",
